  "user": "I'm CUS-0004. Transaction TX-0401, 240.00 EUR: the goods never arrived. Which reason code applies?",
  "answer": "The reason code that matches your situation is **goods_not_received**. Under the dispute rules, it has a 90-day window counted from the transaction date.\n\nFor TX-0401 (240.00 EUR, TechMart Online, 20 July 2026), the window closes on **18 October 2026**. I haven't checked eligibility yet, so I can't confirm the dispute is open to you.\n\nI also see a second identical charge: TX-0402, 240.00 EUR to TechMart Online on 14 July 2026. If that was a separate charge you didn't authorise or a duplicate of the same order, it may need a different code (duplicate_charge). Tell me which applies and I'll check it.\n\nWould you like me to run the eligibility check for TX-0401 under goods_not_received? If it passes, I'll open the dispute on your confirmation.",
